        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia okogora omogondo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Yeremia ase omwaka o ikomi bw’okogamba gwa Zedekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda. Omwaka oyio nigo orenge omwaka o ikomi na gatano na gatato bw’okogamba kwa Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio abarwani b’esegi b’omorwoti o Babiloni nigo baboerete Yerusalemu, na Yeremia omobani agasiekerwa ase egoora y’echela yarenge ase enyomba y’omorwoti bw’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zedekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, konya omosibire, ogoteeba, “Nase ki okobana kogoteeba ng’a aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Rora, nkobeeka nde omochie oyo ase okoboko kw’omorwoti o Babiloni, ayoire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Zedekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, tagotooreka korwa ase amaboko ’Abakalidayo, korende ekeene, goika abekwe ase okoboko kw’omorwoti o Babiloni, akwane nere obosio ase obosio, na kororana nere amaiso ase amaiso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyio naire Zedekia Babiloni, nere agenderere komenya aroro goika inche Omonene imochiere. Namoisa korwania Abakalidayo timokobabua. Nab’Omonene atebiire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeremia agateeba, “Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase ’nde, riganteebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naama! Hanameli, mosinto o Salumu iso moke, nache asore, agoteebie ng’a ogore omogondo oye ore agwo Anatoti, ekiagera omwando oyo naye otungetie, oyogore na koyobooria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Hanameli, omomura o tata moke, agacha ase ’nde agwo ase nasibire, buna Omonene konya akwanire, aganteebia, “Gora omogondo one ore agwo Anatoti, ase ense ya Benjamini, ekiagera naye ochigeete oyogore na koyobooria obe oyoo.” Erio inche nkamanya ng’a riria nigo riarenge ring’ana ri’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa ase Hanameli, momura o tata moke, nkagora omogondo orenge agwo Anatoti. Nkamorengera chitaabu chisekeli chi’echifeta ikomi, na isano na ibere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkarika ekaratasi y’okoyogora, nkayebeka ekemanyererio kiane nkayemumeka; nkarangeria birori, naende nkarenga chitaabu chiria ase ekerengo ki’oborito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabogoria okobwatana koria gw’okogora omogondo komumekire, korikire emeroberio na amang’ana achiikire, amo nokonde kogwekaine koria, korende gotamumekeirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nkaa Baruku, mosinto o Neria, o Maseya, okobwatana koria agwo ase obosio bwa Hanameli, momura o tata moke, na ase amasio a birori baria konya barikire amarieta abo ase okobwatana okwo, boigo nase amasio ’Abayahudi bonsi abwo baikaransete ase egoora y’enyomba y’abasibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngachiika Baruku agwo ase abanto bonsi baigwete, nkamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Imokia okobwatana oko gw’okogorana kw’omogondo, okwo komumekeirie na okwo gotamumekeiri, obeke amakaratasi ayio abeere ase ekeguru gekorire korwa ase amaroba, erinde agenderere kobao ase engaki entambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli agoteeba: Chinyomba na emegondo, amo nemegondo y’emesabibu nabigorwe naende ase ense eye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogosaba kwa Yeremia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Magega konaeire Baruku, mosinto o Neria, okobwatana koria gw’okogorana kw’oboremo ngasaba Omonene nkabora:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene! Naye gwatongete igoro chionsi, na ense, ase okobua kwao na ase okoboko kwao koramboire. Tikeri nonya negento ekemo kegosinyete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye nigo okoorokia obwanchani bwao bwa botambe ase abanto chilifu chinyinge, korende nigo okorua egesusuro ase abana ase engencho y’okomocha kw’abaise. Aye Nyasae ore Omonene bw’echinguru, erieta riao nario Omonene bw’Emeganda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye nigo ore omonene bw’ogosemia, na omobui ase ogokora kwao. Amaiso ao nigo arigereretie chinchera chionsi chia Mwanyabaanto; naye okoa kera omonto eng’eria yaye koreng’ana ne chinchera chiaye, na okwama kw’ogokora kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene kwaorogetie ebikone na amakumia ase ense ya Misiri, naende ase amatuko aya nigo ogendererete kobiorokia ase Abaisraeli na ase Mwanyabaanto bonsi. Aye kwenyoreire erieta rinene goika rituko ria reero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo kwang’anyetie abanto bao Abaisraeli korwa ase ense ya Misiri, ase enchera y’ebikone na amakumia, na okobua okonene, na okoboko koramboire kore ne chinguru, na ase okoondokia okonene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okabaa ense eye kwarierete chisokoro chiabo eira kobayea, ense entenenku ere namabeere na amooke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero bachete ase ense eye na koyeira ebe eyabo, tibakoigwerete gose tibabwatetie amachiiko ao. Ebinto bionsi kwabachigete bakore, tibabikorete nonya nekemo. Ase engencho eyio kwarentire amabe aya onsi igoro ase bare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rora, chiburi chi’ogwekengera chiaagachirwe ase chinsemo chionsi chi’omochie, erinde omochie oirwe. Ase engencho y’esegi, na enchara, na oborwaire, Abakalidayo abwo nabanyare koyoira. Omonene, amang’ana gwakwanete aikeranire, na bono kwayarorire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nonya naboigo, aye Omonene nigo gwanchigeete ng’a ngore omogondo ng’akane chitaabu, naende ndigie birori, nonya omochie oyio obekirwe ase amaboko ’Abakalidayo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Yeremia, rikamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rora, inche ninche Omonene, Nyasae bw’abaanto bonsi. Inee! Egento nkere gensinyete?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aya naro inche Omonene ngoteeba: Rora nkobeeka nde omochie oyo ase amaboko ’Abakalidayo, ee, ase okoboko kwa Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, goika ayoire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakalidayo abwo bayonaaretie nabache bayotongie omorero, bayosambe amo ne chinyomba echio igoro ase ebirama biabo mware gosambera ubani ase enyasae Baali, naende mokarua okoruegwa kw’ebinyugwa ase chinyasae ching’ao, na igo mokangechia nkaba nendamwamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche Omonene nigo ngoteeba iga: Abaisraeli na Abayuda babeire bagendererete gokora ebibe ase obosio bwane korwa obwana bwabo. Ee, Abaisraeli tibakorete kende ekiya, otatiga amabe oka, ayio akangechia nkaba nendamwamu ase engencho y’emeremo y’amaboko abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa engaki omochie oyo oagachetwe goika reero iga, abanto baye babeire bakongechia na kogera endamwamu yane yoke. Bono goika nyosirie orue ase obosio bwane,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera Abaisraeli, na Abayuda, amo nabarwoti babo, na abanene b’amarwoti abo, na abakuani babo, na ababani babo, na abanto bonsi ba Yuda, na aba Yerusalemu, bakorete ebibe bikagera nkaba nendamwamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo baonchokire bang’eire amagega abo gose tari amasio abo. Nonya nabeire nkoborokereria kogenderera botambe, bangire gotegerera amorokererio aane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakarenta emegwekano y’ogosasimwa ere okogechia ase enyomba eyio ekorokwa ase erieta riane, na igo bakayekora ekaba eyetachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaagachera Baali aase aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa, agwo ase Rikura ria mosinto o Hinomu, na aroro bakarua abana babo, abamura na abaiseke, ase enyasae Moleki. Amang’ana ayio inche ntabachigete, gose atarenge ase ebirengererio biane, ng’a bakore okogechia okwo, na ayio akagera Abayuda bonsi bagakora ebibe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eira y’ogosemeria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba igoro y’omochie oyo mogoteeba ng’a obekirwe ase okoboko kw’omorwoti o Babiloni, osirigwe nemioro, na enchara, na oborwaire bogoita:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naama! Ninsangererie abanto abwo korwa ase chinse chionsi ase nabaseretie gochia, ekero narenge nendamwamu, na ekeririanda, na okogechigwa. Nimbairanie aase aiga, naende mbabeeke bamenye ase obotoereru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo mbabe abanto baane, na inche imbe Nyasae obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbakore babe nomoyo oyomo, erinde babe bakobwatia enchera eyemo; erio nario barang’iroke kogenderera botambe, ase engencho y’obuya bwabo, na obw’abana babo bararwe magega yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkore amo nabarabwo okobwatana kw’ogotianania kogenderera botambe, erinde tinkoonchoka ntige kobakorera amaya. Nimbeke obwoba ime ase chinkoro chiabo banyiroke, erinde tibaabaisa koonchoka bantige.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbe nomogooko omonene ase okobakorera amaya, nimbasimeke ase ense eye imbe nobwegenwa bw’enkoro yane yonsi na omoyo one bwonsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba, Buna koreng’ana narentete amabe aria onsi amanene igoro ase abanto aba, naboigo ngochia kobarentera amaya onsi aya nabarierete eira kobarentera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ense eye abanto bagokwana ng’a yasarigwe, yabeire erooro ase abanto batanyare komenya, gose ching’iti, naende ng’a yabekirwe ase amaboko ’Abakalidayo, rora, emegondo negorwe naende aiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emegondo negorwe chitaabu, na okobwatana gw’okoyegora korikwe, erinde amarieta arikwe na kobekwa ekemanyererio, na okobwatana koria komumekerigwe ase birori bare. Ayio nigo arakoreke ase orogongo rwa Benjamini, na ase chinsemo chionsi chia Yerusalemu, na ase emechie y’Abayuda, na ase emechie ere ase ense y’ebigoro na ase ense omweya, na ase emechie ya Negebu. Ning’iranie abanto boosetwe bache ase ense yabo.’ Nab’Omonene atebiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
